    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Pawtiva works fully offline. Your habits, progress and settings are stored only on this device. There is no account, server, advertising, analytics or third-party tracking SDK.\n\nIf Android backup is on, your data is included in your own Google account backup. You can turn this off in your phone\'s system settings.\n\nYou can export your data or delete all of it at any time from this screen.</string>
    <string name="settings_offline">Offline storage</string>
    <string name="settings_offline_body">Everything works without an internet connection. Pawtiva does not use the internet, and your data is never sent anywhere.</string>

